(5093985, 743706, 87808, '<td valign="top">Very good, I am sure this will ribbon.  I love the black silky feel of the liquid against the hands.  The web of black between the fingers add such a dramatic flair.</td>', 'Very good, I am sure this will ribbon.  I love the black silky feel of the liquid against the hands.  The web of black between the fingers add such a dramatic flair.', '2008-12-01 10:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
