(5093993, 743754, 87808, '<td valign="top">Interesting eyes, that drew me more so than the power strip. A little more light on the right hand side of the face would have giving it a little more umpf.</td>', 'Interesting eyes, that drew me more so than the power strip. A little more light on the right hand side of the face would have giving it a little more umpf.', '2008-12-01 10:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094005, 743779, 87808, '<td valign="top">Well, interesting shot, spider kinda looks like a Wolf spider, would have helped give it some power if there was more contrast in her.  I think to pull this off a little better, maybe having the ball covered in a little of the brown leaves would have made it seem a little less like a ball. Nice sharp, clean, good focus.</td>', 'Well, interesting shot, spider kinda looks like a Wolf spider, would have helped give it some power if there was more contrast in her.  I think to pull this off a little better, maybe having the ball covered in a little of the brown leaves would have made it seem a little less like a ball. Nice sharp, clean, good focus.', '2008-12-01 10:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094008, 743638, 87808, '<td valign="top">very cute, a little pixleated though, could do with being a little cleaner. Your fingers are in great focus though.</td>', 'very cute, a little pixleated though, could do with being a little cleaner. Your fingers are in great focus though.', '2008-12-01 10:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
