(5094147, 743736, 56109, '<td valign="top">good idea. I can see some kind of manipulation on the handle and it''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'good idea. I can see some kind of manipulation on the handle and it''s a bit distracting.', '2008-12-01 11:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
