(5105428, 743109, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think the costuming works really well in this, it''s very simple but not overly superhero-y.The lighting is well done, feels warm but not too bright.</td>', 'I think the costuming works really well in this, it''s very simple but not overly superhero-y.The lighting is well done, feels warm but not too bright.', '2008-12-04 11:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
