(5113495, 742866, 71239, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>*Very* nearly missed the point of this - medusa is so strongly associated with snakes I was puzzled that there was no allusion to them in the shot.  Had to go digging to find out about Medusa and her magic/prehensile red hair whereupon it all makes sense.<br/> <br/>Great model, exceptional make-up and wonderful hair.  One of two 10s in the challenge.</td>', 'Coming back to comment. *Very* nearly missed the point of this - medusa is so strongly associated with snakes I was puzzled that there was no allusion to them in the shot.  Had to go digging to find out about Medusa and her magic/prehensile red hair whereupon it all makes sense. Great model, exceptional make-up and wonderful hair.  One of two 10s in the challenge.', '2008-12-07 04:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
