(5115656, 742520, 83313, '<td valign="top">I was very surprised to see this came in under my own shoehorn entry. It''s well lit, sharp and detailed. I would have thought this good for at least a low 5. Only thing I can think of is that it truly was a shoehorn, where mine had some lame superhero figures in it. I would not be true to myself If I did not give you a shoehorn award for both the humor and the shoehorn. Display it proudly or ignore it at your own risk. <i>Mwahahahaha!!!!</i> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737193" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I was very surprised to see this came in under my own shoehorn entry. It''s well lit, sharp and detailed. I would have thought this good for at least a low 5. Only thing I can think of is that it truly was a shoehorn, where mine had some lame superhero figures in it. I would not be true to myself If I did not give you a shoehorn award for both the humor and the shoehorn. Display it proudly or ignore it at your own risk. Mwahahahaha!!!! ', '2008-12-08 00:22:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5115693, 743513, 83313, '<td valign="top">Excellent brown effort, but it looks like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=20168" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Charliebaker</a> has a superpower to grab the brown anytime he wants it!</td>', 'Excellent brown effort, but it looks like  Charliebaker has a superpower to grab the brown anytime he wants it!', '2008-12-08 00:28:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5115699, 743467, 31637, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a great image, and also great for the challenge even though it looks like luminating light and not exactly electricity. The exposure of the orb is so good though that it does look like she is harnessing a great power.</td>', 'Congrats on a great image, and also great for the challenge even though it looks like luminating light and not exactly electricity. The exposure of the orb is so good though that it does look like she is harnessing a great power.', '2008-12-08 00:29:35.000000', NULL, 0),
