(5115761, 742520, 18197, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yospiff:</b></div><hr/><i> I was very surprised to see this came in under my own shoehorn entry. It''s well lit, sharp and detailed. I would have thought this good for at least a low 5. Only thing I can think of is that it truly was a shoehorn, where mine had some lame superhero figures in it. I would not be true to myself If I did not give you a shoehorn award for both the humor and the shoehorn. Display it proudly or ignore it at your own risk. <i>Mwahahahaha!!!!</i> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737193" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I humbly accept the award with all due respect to the academy and my critics, and with profound disappointment in the Nobel nominating committee. I will proudly display it on my profile page.</td>', 'Originally posted by yospiff: I was very surprised to see this came in under my own shoehorn entry. It''s well lit, sharp and detailed. I would have thought this good for at least a low 5. Only thing I can think of is that it truly was a shoehorn, where mine had some lame superhero figures in it. I would not be true to myself If I did not give you a shoehorn award for both the humor and the shoehorn. Display it proudly or ignore it at your own risk. Mwahahahaha!!!!    I humbly accept the award with all due respect to the academy and my critics, and with profound disappointment in the Nobel nominating committee. I will proudly display it on my profile page.', '2008-12-08 00:47:41.000000', NULL, 0),
