(5116585, 743132, 61961, '<td valign="top">Hi, Jamie.  You wrote "this was shot on a blue background. Levels and color balance, hue &amp; sat had adjustments made on them to darken it down to a dark blue/black (depending on your monitor). I then, used the dodge tool to lighten up the area around the model."<br/> <br/>If that is true, then this shouldn''t have been disqualified!</td>', 'Hi, Jamie.  You wrote "this was shot on a blue background. Levels and color balance, hue & sat had adjustments made on them to darken it down to a dark blue/black (depending on your monitor). I then, used the dodge tool to lighten up the area around the model." If that is true, then this shouldn''t have been disqualified!', '2008-12-08 09:20:56.000000', NULL, 0),
