(5116656, 743707, 67697, '<td valign="top">i saw the face right away lol so not sure what that says.  I thought it was an interesting take on it as that kind of expression is something you might see in a comic book.</td>', 'i saw the face right away lol so not sure what that says.  I thought it was an interesting take on it as that kind of expression is something you might see in a comic book.', '2008-12-08 09:48:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5116695, 743774, 57229, '<td valign="top">Once again you remind us that the brown ribbon is a valuable trophy.<br/>Elemental transmutation is not of itself a superpower but it is obviously enough a potential one and must be intended as such within the context of the challenge.<br/>The picture makes the fatal mistake of portraying the superpower itself, as opposed to some popular iconic representation of a fictive character who...<br/>Well done and thank you.</td>', 'Once again you remind us that the brown ribbon is a valuable trophy.Elemental transmutation is not of itself a superpower but it is obviously enough a potential one and must be intended as such within the context of the challenge.The picture makes the fatal mistake of portraying the superpower itself, as opposed to some popular iconic representation of a fictive character who...Well done and thank you.', '2008-12-08 09:57:41.000000', NULL, 0),
